r24612 | sveinung | 2014-03-05 11:30:22 +0200 (Wed, 05 Mar 2014) | 17 lines
Changed paths:
   M /trunk/ai/default/aicity.c
   M /trunk/ai/default/aidiplomat.c
   M /trunk/client/helpdata.c
   M /trunk/common/effects.h
